89.jpg"}, {"id": 1805626, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12p8a.jpg"}, {"id": 1805627, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12p8b.jpg"}, {"id": 1805628, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12p8c.jpg"}], "slug": "fading-five", "summary": "Fading Five is a free browser-based strategy game built on the classic five-in-a-row formula with a unique twist: every mark placed has a limited lifespan and gradually fades away, forcing players to factor timing and sequencing into their strategy alongside spatial positioning. The game features a large game board, support for 1-3 players, online multiplayer via room codes and matchmaking, bot opponents, and a local hot-seat mode.Two game variants are available: Classic, with standard fading rules, and Switch, which rotates color assignments between players mid-game. Free to play with no download or account required.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fading-five"}